    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally positioned within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, this well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence offers comfortable accommodation in an established and convenient neighbourhood. The ground floor comprises a generous living and dining room, a compact kitchen, and a downstairs bathroom, providing practical and comfortable living accommodation. Upstairs, the property offers three bedrooms together with a family bathroom. One of the property's key features is its large rear garden, offering excellent potential for further development, subject to the necessary planning permission. It is ideally located close to local schools, shops, parks and amenities, while Tralee town centre is also within easy walking distance. Its proximity to Bon Secours Hospital and Kerins O'Rahillys GAA Club further adds to its appeal.\r\nThis property would make an excellent family home, first-time purchase or downsize opportunity, offering a superb combination of location, convenience and future potential."
      },
